      {
        "body": "Research inspected the small local search workspace and primary documentation. Local order_results preserves incoming order; no query matcher or browser persistence implementation is present, so ID ordering and reload reset cannot be independently reproduced here. Options identified: bounded application-level typo matching, existing database search capabilities if available, or a search engine; explicit relevance ordering with a stable tie-breaker; URL, session or persistent filter state. These remain options, with no implementation choice approved and no code changed.",
